2026-10-14T20:23:10.5531707Z PASS tests/contracts/lab_governance_wp_b.test.js
2026-10-14T20:23:10.5532733Z   WP-B: Unified Action and Scope Model
2026-10-14T20:23:10.5533887Z     1. Unified Action and Resource Policy Resolver (actionPolicyService)
2026-10-14T20:23:10.5535165Z       ✓ Super Admin can manage any user and any lab (2 ms)
2026-10-14T20:23:10.5536100Z       ✓ Lab Manager can manage subordinate in own lab, but not in another lab (1 ms)
2026-10-14T20:23:10.5537094Z       ✓ Lab Manager cannot manage peer manager or project manager (1 ms)
2026-10-14T20:23:10.5537918Z       ✓ Lab Manager cannot elevate technician to manager role
2026-10-14T20:23:10.5538767Z       ✓ Self-role change is rejected with SELF_MANAGEMENT_FORBIDDEN (1 ms)
2026-10-14T20:23:10.5539560Z       ✓ Inactive actor is denied with ACTOR_INACTIVE
2026-10-14T20:23:10.5540729Z     2. Project-to-Lab Canonical Membership Resolver (projectMembershipService)
2026-10-14T20:23:10.5541881Z       ✓ resolveProjectLabs correctly identifies owner and servicing laboratories (3 ms)
2026-10-14T20:23:10.5542856Z       ✓ getDiscrepancyReport scans database and returns audit report without data loss (5 ms)
2026-10-14T20:23:10.5543640Z       ✓ canManageProject allows owner lab manager and super admin; denies non-owner manager
2026-10-14T20:23:10.5544272Z     3. Assignable Roles Server Catalogue (GET /api/access/assignable-roles)
2026-10-14T20:23:10.5544857Z       ✓ Super Admin gets all 10 roles in assignableRoles (12 ms)
2026-10-14T20:23:10.5545596Z       ✓ Lab Manager gets only ALLOWED_SUB_ROLES and sees peer/admin roles as unmanageable with reasons (10 ms)
2026-10-14T20:23:10.5546361Z       ✓ Ordinary viewer is denied access to assignable-roles (403 Forbidden) (20 ms)
2026-10-14T20:23:10.5547028Z       ✓ GET /api/access/capabilities returns platform role capabilities (55 ms)
2026-10-14T20:23:10.5547559Z     4. Work Assignment Eligibility & Validation (A23, LG-17, A33)
2026-10-14T20:23:10.5548251Z       ✓ A23: Assignment to deactivated technician is rejected with ASSIGNEE_INACTIVE (400) (13 ms)
2026-10-14T20:23:10.5548970Z       ✓ A23: Assignment to technician in different lab is rejected with 403 (7 ms)
2026-10-14T20:23:10.5549656Z       ✓ A23: Assignment in paused/inactive lab is rejected with LAB_PAUSED (400) (13 ms)
2026-10-14T20:23:10.5550761Z       ✓ GET /api/work/eligible-assignees returns active analytical staff and excludes deactivated staff (8 ms)
2026-10-14T20:23:10.5551449Z     5. Staff Directory Scoping & Bounded Pagination (LG-08, LG-22)
2026-10-14T20:23:10.5552118Z       ✓ LG-08: National user directory is strictly scoped to labs in authorized country (6 ms)
2026-10-14T20:23:10.5552863Z       ✓ LG-08: National user with empty country scope receives empty array (not global leak) (4 ms)
2026-10-14T20:23:10.5553593Z       ✓ GET /api/users/directory?purpose=assignment filters to active analytical staff (5 ms)
2026-10-14T20:23:10.5554384Z       ✓ GET /api/users enforces bounded pagination (clamps excessive limit to 100) and excludes password (8 ms)
